\left|\frac{1}{2} - \frac{3}{8}i\right| = \sqrt{\left(\frac{1}{2}\right)^2 + \left(-\frac{3}{8}\right)^2} = \sqrt{\frac{1}{4} + \frac{9}{64}} = \sqrt{\frac{16}{64} + \frac{9}{64}} = \sqrt{\frac{25}{64}} = \frac{5}{8}
\] </think> <answer> \(\frac{5}{8}\) </answer>

